---
description: linx SDLC — required workflow for every task in this repo
alwaysApply: true
---
This project follows the linx workflow (see the "Development workflow (linx)" section of AGENTS.md).
Start every task — feature, bug, small change or code question — with the `linx-start` skill. If a skill is not
offered automatically, read `.cursor/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` directly.

Cursor has no subagents: run plan tasks inline, one at a time. Use a strong model for spec, plan and review, and a
fast model for executing an approved plan.
